## Scratch git worktrees, one per background agent. Each is a full checkout with its own build
## output, so they are large and they are never part of the history: the work in them is landed by
## cherry-picking the branch, not by committing the directory. Remove a finished one with
## `git worktree remove`; `git worktree list` shows what is still there.
.claude/worktrees/
